    "wikipedia_summary": "<i><b>Lathyrus ochrus</b></i>, the <b>Cyprus vetch</b>, is a species of annual herb in the family Fabaceae. They are climbers and have compound, broad leaves. Flowers are visited by Old World swallowtails and <i>Oxythyrea funesta</i>.",
